# =============================================================================
# Proof-of-concept credentials for tests/sync_poc.rs
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in this folder (tax-statements-analysis/src-tauri/),
# fill in the values, then run:
#
#   cd tax-statements-analysis/src-tauri
#   cargo test --test sync_poc -- --ignored --nocapture
#
# `.env` is git-ignored; this template is not. Never commit real keys.
# =============================================================================

